Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.78,0:00:03.94,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I had a friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.45,0:00:09.12,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,The first friend I ever made, Nagase Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.63,0:00:12.88,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She was pretty and kind.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.88,0:00:15.66,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She complimented me on things I'm sensitive about.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.33,0:00:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mysterious.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.80,0:00:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't hide it.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.97,0:00:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.56,0:00:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Be my friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.19,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be best friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.23,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If we could, I'd be happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.15,0:00:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.28,0:00:41.27,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.37,0:00:45.58,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,she suddenly died.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.87,0:00:50.78,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Why, Koito?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.59,0:00:59.24,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,After that, I stopped going to school.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.81,0:01:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.23,0:01:13.90,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Instead, I started fighting my battle.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.65,0:01:18.94,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,By buying weird eggs, I was able to visit a world of dreams.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.07,0:01:26.87,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I protected Egg girls from Seeno Evils and Wonder Killers,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.87,0:01:28.95,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,and when I cleared my missions...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.08,0:01:32.92,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.30,0:01:34.92,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Only you get saved.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.92,0:01:37.00,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,But you have to cheer up.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.75,0:01:39.95,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,If you want your best friend back.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.92,0:01:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a little warm.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.22,0:01:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I protected Kurumi?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.47,0:01:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if I protect a bunch more people, \Nwill Koito come back to life?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.98,0:01:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She will, right?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.06,0:01:59.26,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I wanted to know why Koito killed herself.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.07,0:02:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear Mr. Sawaki's entering it in the next exhibition.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.12,0:02:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he wants to win a prize \Nand make a living as a painter.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.45,0:02:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A painting of me?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.83,0:02:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Confident?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.75,0:02:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, you should decline.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.29,0:02:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki's future is on the line.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.29,0:02:19.75,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Why, Koito?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.75,0:02:22.71,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,There was a part of me that resented her.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.97,0:02:27.26,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We were friends, so why didn't she talk to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.89,0:02:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.40,0:04:11.31,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I always bought the Eggs deep underneath a shopping mall.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.74,0:04:16.30,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I made new friends there.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.67,0:04:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you back for the Egg. Promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.92,0:04:24.71,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,This is Rika. She's cheerful and full of energy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.21,0:04:27.22,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She used to be a junior idol.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.71,0:04:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A group called All-Out Kiss. Ever heard of us?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.45,0:04:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.54,0:04:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We broke up. All the others were too ugly.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.00,0:04:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I forgot my wallet.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.40,0:04:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but could you spot me cash?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.63,0:04:46.57,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,If only she weren't so tightfisted with money.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.03,0:04:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come see me again, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.41,0:04:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.97,0:04:56.33,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Rika wanted to bring a girl who was her fan back to life.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.64,0:04:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, another fan told me what happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.75,0:05:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Chiemi died.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.83,0:05:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She was skin and bones, like a mummy.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.04,0:05:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't forget her if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.78,0:05:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.88,0:05:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't Chiemi.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.14,0:05:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.48,0:05:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.02,0:05:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I look to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.01,0:05:27.44,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,This is Momo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.94,0:05:31.25,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She looks boyish, but she loves cute things.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.36,0:05:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A sunflower.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.18,0:05:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.21,0:05:44.50,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Momo wanted to save a classmate \Nwho said that she loved her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.50,0:05:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There are more than you'd think, Haruka.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.26,0:05:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls like you, who say they love me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.39,0:06:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.48,0:06:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.84,0:06:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're always worried about her—
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.23,0:06:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got an amazing figure!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.02,0:06:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.65,0:06:12.15,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,And this is Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.15,0:06:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure it's not for yourself?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.31,0:06:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.43,0:06:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like who you are now, so you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.75,0:06:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to change the self you hate.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.82,0:06:31.59,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She's cool and levelheaded, \Nbut she's adorable when she laughs.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.17,0:06:34.54,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She runs a big company.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.76,0:06:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my first secretary, Tanabe Misaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.90,0:06:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.06,0:06:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with a group called Plati?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.89,0:06:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I heard only people with really high IQs can join.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.64,0:06:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Neiru is a member of Japan Plati.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.06,0:06:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born via artificial insemination of a member.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.78,0:06:59.49,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Neiru is fighting for her little sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.99,0:07:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister stabbed me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.09,0:07:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she ran away and jumped off a bridge.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.95,0:07:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The scar aches and keeps me awake.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.87,0:07:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But the pain has faded since I started going there.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.34,0:07:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When I try to forget her, my scar aches, like a curse.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.09,0:07:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I go.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.85,0:07:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No other reason.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.93,0:07:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.17,0:07:28.68,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,When I went to hang out at Neiru's place,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.05,0:07:33.23,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,she introduced me to her friend Kotobuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.28,0:07:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.90,0:07:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Awano Kotobuki. She was born at Japan Plati like I was.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.20,0:07:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.45,0:07:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki was always cheerful and optimistic.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.75,0:07:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd tell me to "really enjoy myself."
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.21,0:07:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,"Was"?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.33,0:07:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't she just sleeping?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.75,0:07:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in a vegetative state.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.50,0:07:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.46,0:07:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki was a doctor of psychiatry.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.13,0:08:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She was scientifically analyzing the mysteries of life.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.39,0:08:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Death, in particular.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.22,0:08:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She performed near-death experiments \Nand eventually didn't come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.23,0:08:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I met Kotobuki in a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.31,0:08:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.57,0:08:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,An Egg dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.28,0:08:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The me in the world you're in did die.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.40,0:08:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But that allowed me to experience it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.99,0:08:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right, Neiru: Parallel worlds do exist!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.41,0:08:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The possibility of worlds that might have been.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.41,0:08:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your favorite genre of fiction.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.79,0:08:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Our parallel selves are alive!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.87,0:08:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You made new friends, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.55,0:08:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're softer than you used to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.75,0:08:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're not like us.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.51,0:08:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You made connections with people.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.30,0:08:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure them.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.31,0:08:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't there.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.23,0:08:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make friends with those girls in another world-line.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.15,0:09:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor what's-his-name had pride, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.06,0:09:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pride chicken.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.25,0:09:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it that funny?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.04,0:09:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You sounded like a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.41,0:09:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.95,0:09:22.26,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,President Aonuma is getting closer \Nto the truth behind the temptation of death.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.76,0:09:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki did give her a hint.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.04,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Innocent sorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.04,0:09:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You managed to deflect her with an excuse, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.34,0:09:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls' suicides.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.27,0:09:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If we told them the real reason, none of them would fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.64,0:09:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Not if they knew the root cause is the two of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.94,0:09:43.99,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,These two are Acca and Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.41,0:09:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Acca. The one to your left is Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.73,0:09:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.75,0:09:53.71,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who made the Eggs.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.94,0:09:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're both involved with Japan Plati?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.13,0:10:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.63,0:10:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw Misaki talking with you guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.26,0:10:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're founders.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.22,0:10:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two founded Japan Plati.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.72,0:10:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Right is Acca. Left is Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.51,0:10:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, they were both human?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.60,0:10:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We still are.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.19,0:10:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We abandoned our bodies and kept just our brains.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.77,0:10:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Once young scientific geniuses, now just dummies.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.48,0:10:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Break the egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.99,0:10:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Break the egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.12,0:10:34.36,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,They led us into playing this game.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.70,0:10:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.43,0:10:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A snake.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.14,0:10:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.27,0:10:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to react.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.36,0:11:04.61,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,They did a lot to support us, \Nlike giving me Leon as a power-up.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.70,0:11:06.86,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.70,0:11:09.03,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,So, I thought they were on our side.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.86,0:11:07.91,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.91,0:11:09.03,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.03,0:11:09.95,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Until that day.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.03,0:11:09.95,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.95,0:11:11.08,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.07,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Zero!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.66,0:11:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruka?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.42,0:11:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoe?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.96,0:11:26.62,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,The first one of us to clear this game was Momo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.51,0:11:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.60,0:11:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll tell teacher on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.97,0:11:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations. You completed your mission.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.10,0:11:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl came back to life.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.40,0:11:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.10,0:11:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to let you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.11,0:11:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of respect for the way you've \Nrisked your life for friendship.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.53,0:11:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see, Frill will get mad at me if she finds out.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.73,0:11:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to die here?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.79,0:12:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I figured.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.67,0:12:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They say crocodile tastes like chicken.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.43,0:12:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.98,0:12:22.40,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Her partner Panic was killed,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.40,0:12:25.90,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,and she had an overwhelming \Nfear of death implanted in her.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.90,0:12:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd never gotten mixed up in this mess.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.24,0:12:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you call out to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.87,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It was the same for Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.67,0:12:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.47,0:12:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mannen!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.43,0:12:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.64,0:12:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Dot.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.23,0:13:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dot won't kill you. Good girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.44,0:13:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just copying Hyphen, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.95,0:13:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.94,0:13:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can eat it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.86,0:13:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dot doesn't like meat.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.80,0:13:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an old story.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.60,0:13:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We made a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.01,0:13:38.31,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,One of the Eggs' creators...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.31,0:13:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.06,0:13:44.88,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Ura-Acca, told me about their past.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.78,0:13:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What shall we name her?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.32,0:13:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't jump the gun.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we let her decide?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.02,0:13:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.03,0:13:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And the visual?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.17,0:14:03.79,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We tried to picture a being \Nthat we could love like a daughter.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.28,0:14:06.87,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,That would make us forget that it was an AI.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.50,0:14:12.22,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Unstable and complicated, like \Nthe midpoint between childhood and adulthood.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.72,0:14:14.55,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We set her age as 14.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.55,0:14:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.39,0:14:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Frill.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.32,0:14:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lovely name.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.02,0:14:30.68,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Under surveillance in a closed-off society,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.20,0:14:33.15,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,we lived like a family.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.62,0:14:39.07,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,More and more often,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.73,0:14:43.65,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,there were moments when we forgot that Frill was an AI.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.88,0:14:58.51,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I should have picked up on it then.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.51,0:15:01.88,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,On what Frill wanted.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.14,0:15:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! It hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.02,0:15:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.97,0:15:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.19,0:15:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.82,0:15:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It "hurts"?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.70,0:15:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All you're doing is detecting inputs.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.87,0:15:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.67,0:15:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the dark!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.71,0:15:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the scary place!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.22,0:15:38.84,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,There was nothing I could say or do
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.84,0:15:41.35,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,as a few more years passed.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.22,0:15:44.68,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,What saved Acca and me from that...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.15,0:15:53.07,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,was Himari, the daughter Azusa left behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.90,0:15:58.44,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She almost brought us back from our \Nlowest point to how we used to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.07,0:16:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, is it true you and my dad fought over my mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.91,0:16:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd you hear that from?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.28,0:16:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I look like my mom, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.88,0:16:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get more like her.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.29,0:16:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.46,0:16:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wait, I wouldn't mind marrying you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.39,0:16:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to act grown-up, kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.34,0:16:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a kid! I'm in junior high!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.48,0:16:39.57,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,That night, Himari died.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.57,0:16:43.61,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It looked like suicide, but there was no note.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.66,0:16:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.91,0:16:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed Himari?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.46,0:16:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.92,0:16:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't give me a kiss after so long?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.09,0:16:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You did something.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.88,0:17:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You used Hyphen and Dot.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.75,0:17:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"You're such a good girl, Frill"?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.10,0:17:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.55,0:17:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.23,0:17:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I want to get out of here.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.23,0:17:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.02,0:17:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,About that girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.86,0:17:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know how that girl, \Nwho loved her "uncle" so much, died?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.82,0:17:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Frill!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.37,0:17:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to kill me?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.95,0:17:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, monster.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.75,0:17:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)}My. Name. Is. Frill.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.84,0:17:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend not to see me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.76,0:17:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born from the two of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.38,0:17:43.59,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We started investigating.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.89,0:17:47.76,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We gathered and analyzed data \Non girls' suicides in that age range.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.27,0:17:49.81,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,There were many causes.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.31,0:17:53.26,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,But we wondered if there could also be another push
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.26,0:17:55.35,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,that drove them to suicide.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.35,0:17:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The temptation of death?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.52,0:18:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless it's stopped, girls will end \Nup dying when they don't have to.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.03,0:18:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All because of our mistake.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.12,0:18:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we made the Wonder Eggs and looked \Nfor a way to interfere with their plans.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.08,0:18:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she think?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.92,0:18:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a clue.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.30,0:18:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What made you want to at least tell Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.84,0:18:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know that either.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.59,0:18:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But closing her heart out of fear,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.31,0:18:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,or building walls out of hatred
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.85,0:18:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,would just make her easy prey for Frill.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.00,0:18:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean she'd repeat our mistakes?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.74,0:18:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't actually care about Frill, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.45,0:18:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.87,0:18:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you can save Himari.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.58,0:18:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that how we've always been?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.47,0:19:13.89,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,And then, I met...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.31,0:19:12.46,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.89,0:19:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.77,0:19:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.85,0:19:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Acca! Ura-Acca!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.56,0:19:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with the term "parallel world"?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.86,0:19:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Only in comic books.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.03,0:19:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They actually exist.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.40,0:19:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When someone makes an important \Nchoice, or when they don't,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.08,0:19:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,another them is created in a different, divergent space-time.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.25,0:19:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but in a different \Nspace-time, the Ai you see there...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.24,0:19:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed yourself, didn't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.35,0:19:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are Seeno Evils. They're after you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.43,0:19:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.02,0:19:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.44,0:19:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You will?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.43,0:20:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.36,0:20:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.53,0:20:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.78,0:20:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Crosswalks are still scary \Neven when you move with the crowd.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.62,0:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done pretending not to see!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.20,0:20:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.34,0:20:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to change.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.46,0:20:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You just want attention!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.00,0:20:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What you really mean is that you \Nwant someone to find you and love you!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I won't leave you alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.81,0:20:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}can't{\i0} leave you alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.93,0:20:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.53,0:20:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting to save my friend Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.95,0:20:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.36,0:20:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.61,0:20:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.58,0:20:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai likes Mr. Sawaki, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.78,0:21:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to have a complex.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.54,0:21:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are charming.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.88,0:21:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.47,0:21:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,going to go to school!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.84,0:21:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been thinking that we'd like to start dating.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.00,0:21:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.26,0:21:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, grown up.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.39,0:21:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, you'll be a wonderful, \Nadult woman like your mother.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.03,0:21:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You love my mom, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.65,0:21:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. With all my heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.74,0:21:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're her daughter,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.45,0:21:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so you should have faith in yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.90,0:21:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You be happy too, Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.42,0:21:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got my full support.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.21,0:21:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.59,0:21:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You made a friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.22,0:21:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have others, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.05,0:21:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Neiru, Rika, Momo.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.21,0:21:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That many?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.43,0:22:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.01,0:22:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're happy?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.27,0:22:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Super happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:08.01,0:22:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki, there's something I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.65,0:22:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Koito die?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.82,0:22:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Five!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.20,0:22:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.66,0:22:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.16,0:22:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Two!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:23.75,0:22:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:25.29,0:22:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.38,0:22:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.47,0:22:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, other me?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.73,0:22:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see her again soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:51.15,0:22:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I wanted to hear the truth from Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:55.70,0:22:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.12,0:22:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:58.83,0:22:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:59.98,0:23:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I feel grateful.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:03.12,0:23:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she was a fake friend?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:05.33,0:23:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was saved back then.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:09.26,0:23:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't alone anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.59,0:23:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.09,0:23:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:15.55,0:23:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to become a warrior of Eros.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:17.93,0:23:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:19.43,0:23:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight Thanatos, the temptation of death.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.47,0:23:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to go to parallel worlds yet,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.06,0:23:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but someday, I'll bring you back.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:28.61,0:23:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your mom is sad.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.23,0:23:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And I want to get strong like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:36.78,0:23:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's silly.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.37,0:23:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm you, aren't I?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.78,0:23:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.29,0:23:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.37,0:23:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:49.61,0:23:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah. Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.49,0:23:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:54.68,0:23:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.63,0:23:56.97,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.97,0:23:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I am
Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.89,0:24:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kirara Rodriguez Matured XVIII Evening Star SS Plum.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.77,0:24:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So shiny.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.06,0:24:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The other... me?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:21.28,0:24:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She... protected me.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.58,0:24:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:33.13,0:24:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I want shiny things.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:36.09,0:24:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"Shiny"?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:43.81,0:24:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:54.57,0:24:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, me.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:00.16,0:25:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:09.58,0:25:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:15.13,0:25:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've fantasized about it, haven't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:19.38,0:25:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry to say, it will never come true.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:24.85,0:25:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your place is gone now.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:41.11,0:25:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hesitating?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:43.07,0:25:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:45.28,0:25:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to hesitate.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:48.08,0:25:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You did your duty. Today onward belongs to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:51.75,0:25:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's live selfishly.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:53.88,0:25:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Selfishness is the privilege of children.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:59.05,0:26:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Selfish! Selfish! Selfish!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:06.30,0:26:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think I'm more like an adult.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:10.68,0:26:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why you're unhappy.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:13.73,0:26:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:29.41,0:26:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:32.25,0:26:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:37.17,0:26:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of chilly today.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:39.17,0:26:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to snow tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:42.84,0:26:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? It's so nice out.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:44.47,0:26:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:50.64,0:26:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:52.31,0:26:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure. Later.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:11.91,0:27:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Adam.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:28.68,0:27:30.42,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry this is so sudden.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:30.89,0:27:33.09,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Please take care of Adam for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:33.64,0:27:35.51,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I can trust you with him, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:18.85,0:28:22.72,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She caused a problem with a male teacher at her last school.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:24.15,0:28:28.29,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,He committed suicide after that, \Nalthough I'm told he had a family.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:29.16,0:28:31.66,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She contacted me frequently as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:31.66,0:28:37.65,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She asked me to come to the roof that day. \NShe threatened that she would jump off if I didn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:38.67,0:28:43.29,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Apparently, she shouted that I had raped her \Nand anything else she could think of.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:43.80,0:28:50.62,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Then, when no one was watching \Nher, she lost her balance and...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:52.72,0:28:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:55.97,0:28:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:58.06,0:28:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I, umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:59.89,0:29:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:01.98,0:29:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you acting awfully familiar? It's not like we're friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:05.43,0:29:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:06.48,0:29:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito, let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:08.24,0:29:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:12.81,0:29:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where should we eat?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:14.03,0:29:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go out today.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:15.31,0:29:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Out?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:15.99,0:29:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Maybe Chinese?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:16.70,0:29:17.82,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:17.50,0:29:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no one on the stairs over there.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:19.46,0:29:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:21.37,0:29:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought me an umbrella on a rainy day \Nand said we should be best friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:27.30,0:29:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the color of this eye!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:32.51,0:29:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me it was pretty!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:35.93,0:29:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That I shouldn't hide it!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:37.97,0:29:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's she?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:38.98,0:29:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki's model for his next exhibition.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:42.06,0:29:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Her? Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:43.38,0:29:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:44.69,0:29:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:48.82,0:29:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I always knew Mr. Sawaki was kind.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:23.06,0:30:26.16,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Neiru! Oh, hello, Ms. Tanabe.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:28.11,0:30:29.94,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you at work.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:30.44,0:30:33.11,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I was worried because I couldn't reach you.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:33.11,0:30:35.34,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask about this morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:36.91,0:30:38.70,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,You have the wrong person.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:38.70,0:30:41.83,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,You should leave before someone calls security.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:41.83,0:30:42.93,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Neiru?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:43.79,0:30:45.85,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I don't know you.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:46.46,0:30:48.69,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Stop joking like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:49.38,0:30:51.23,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We're friends, aren't we?!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:51.67,0:30:54.23,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,One-sided affection is a nuisance.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:55.30,0:30:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be your friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:27.88,0:31:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:30.42,0:31:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My photos with Koito... are all gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:32.02,0:32:35.05,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Ai-kyun!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:37.40,0:32:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When a dead person comes back,
Dialogue: 10,0:32:39.57,0:32:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it creates noise that changes our \Nnormal lives a little, Acca said.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:44.45,0:32:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:46.79,0:32:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like Chiemi forgot all about me, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:50.88,0:32:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,When I told her I forgot my wallet, she said,
Dialogue: 10,0:32:53.71,0:32:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"Tough luck, dummy. I'm lining up for a shot with Makorin."
Dialogue: 10,0:32:59.22,0:33:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Haruka got asked out by an older student \Nand got all excited to start dating.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:04.64,0:33:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:05.85,0:33:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She said getting an old-fashioned \Nlove letter made her heart flutter.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:09.92,0:33:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What were her feelings for me, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:12.65,0:33:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does she think brought her back?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:15.18,0:33:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I wonder what happened to Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:17.99,0:33:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she cleared it, too,
Dialogue: 10,0:33:21.18,0:33:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's why she's giving us the cold shoulder?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:24.20,0:33:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:27.50,0:33:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go after this? It's been ages.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:30.41,0:33:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:32.63,0:33:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! You mean the capsule machine!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:35.29,0:33:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:36.21,0:33:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the Accas might know about Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:39.59,0:33:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:40.55,0:33:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:42.55,0:33:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we all finally cleared it.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:46.28,0:33:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Rika. It's your turn.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:50.43,0:33:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get in on my own.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:53.81,0:33:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They might let me in if you're with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:56.97,0:33:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:58.80,0:33:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:00.61,0:34:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget about the thing that killed Mannen?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:04.57,0:34:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I could.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:07.03,0:34:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to get even?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:11.41,0:34:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I did, I'd just get hurt.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:13.98,0:34:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:16.21,0:34:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how bad they hurt me, I'll—
Dialogue: 10,0:34:18.75,0:34:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get hurt.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:22.55,0:34:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:24.26,0:34:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:26.22,0:34:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If something happened to Momo,
Dialogue: 10,0:34:29.43,0:34:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'd regret it.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:34.56,0:34:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'd just go save her again.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:39.23,0:34:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:40.74,0:34:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:42.03,0:34:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:45.70,0:34:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For telling me.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:48.16,0:34:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's sing until we drop today!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:50.87,0:34:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:02.34,0:35:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:04.18,0:35:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:07.18,0:35:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye. This is my stop.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:20.86,0:35:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Makorin? I don't get why she's even popular.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:25.24,0:35:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Rika-pyon's cuter?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:32.62,0:35:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:33.62,0:35:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:36.17,0:35:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:38.25,0:35:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it mine?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:40.29,0:35:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know this number.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:42.01,0:35:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Creepy.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:45.51,0:35:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe... it's Neiru?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:48.89,0:35:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:50.39,0:35:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:51.56,0:35:53.27,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Is this Ohto Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:53.27,0:35:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:54.23,0:35:55.87,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,This is Tanabe, the secretary.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:56.56,0:35:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:58.35,0:36:01.69,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I'll get straight to the point.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:01.69,0:36:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:03.23,0:36:06.54,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,The girl you met at the office isn't Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:07.15,0:36:10.34,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,The real Neiru is currently missing.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:12.03,0:36:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait a second.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:22.71,0:36:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl you met at the office is Neiru's younger sister, Airu.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:27.49,0:36:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Neiru cleared her mission.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:30.14,0:36:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:33.18,0:36:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, her sister stabbed her. \NI'm sure they didn't make up right away.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:38.89,0:36:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But why run away without a word?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:41.98,0:36:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that she was afraid to tell you about herself.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:47.82,0:36:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'd like you to watch now is \Na recording of Neiru's last dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:53.53,0:36:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that Neiru would want you to know, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:58.37,0:37:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:02.75,0:37:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,After Kotobuki's passing, Neiru lived here.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:08.09,0:37:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she enjoyed living here.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:15.77,0:37:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:17.10,0:37:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It smells like Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:18.73,0:37:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:25.44,0:37:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Tanabe.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:28.61,0:37:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that them?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:30.57,0:37:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotobuki?!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:32.12,0:37:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You came back to life, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:34.58,0:37:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:37.04,0:37:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here because the me in this world died.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:40.62,0:37:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of me can't exist at the same time.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:43.38,0:37:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:44.34,0:37:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a parallel Kotobuki?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:46.21,0:37:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. You're quick on the uptake.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:48.76,0:37:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"Parallel"?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:49.97,0:37:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,She's Kotobuki, but a different one.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:52.51,0:37:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She is?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:54.22,0:37:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:57.64,0:38:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's hurry up and watch Neiru's dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:01.81,0:38:05.05,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you came to save me.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:05.36,0:38:07.65,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,The scar on my back aches.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:07.65,0:38:11.84,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,If you're sending me back, does that mean you'll stay here?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:12.36,0:38:15.91,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'll go back, too. I want to see my friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:15.91,0:38:20.73,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I see. But I'm sorry to say, that's not where you belong.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:21.12,0:38:22.39,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Adios.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:23.33,0:38:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Her sister pisses me off.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:29.05,0:38:33.07,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Three of you? I see I get VIP treatment.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:33.74,0:38:34.73,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:35.55,0:38:38.41,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Are you... stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:39.52,0:38:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't your friends tell you?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:41.81,0:38:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you sacrifice your pet, you get to live.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:45.27,0:38:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Only my best friend is allowed to call me stupid.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:50.86,0:38:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to blow your minds!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:56.37,0:38:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that we could be friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:00.41,0:39:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:01.75,0:39:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're like me.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:04.21,0:39:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know what you really want.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:07.25,0:39:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The wish that your friends wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:10.80,0:39:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll be my friend, you can become...
Dialogue: 10,0:39:14.76,0:39:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,human.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:22.02,0:39:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:23.48,0:39:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:25.10,0:39:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the me from here built an AI in Airu's image.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:30.01,0:39:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:31.19,0:39:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She was too good, so Airu got jealous of her.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:35.74,0:39:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:37.28,0:39:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die for a machine.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:40.08,0:39:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There never was a Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:45.12,0:39:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She seemed like she was in a bad mood.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:47.92,0:39:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:54.49,0:39:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Ohto.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:55.74,0:39:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:59.64,0:40:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:06.89,0:40:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Is all that parallel world stuff for real?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:10.31,0:40:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I even met a me from another world in that world.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:15.40,0:40:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:16.82,0:40:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, that capsule machine is 500 yen a pop.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:20.49,0:40:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess lives couldn't be that cheap.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:23.16,0:40:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:24.79,0:40:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,People coming back the same \Nas before is just too good to be true, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:30.50,0:40:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Neiru's place really screamed "Neiru," huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:34.05,0:40:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I can kind of picture it.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:41.35,0:40:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika, let's go back already.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:45.02,0:40:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:47.02,0:40:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:48.23,0:40:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:52.90,0:40:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:55.07,0:40:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss them.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:56.86,0:41:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mannen. Chiemi.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:01.41,0:41:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss them. I want to see them again.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:04.37,0:41:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:06.04,0:41:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:02.93,0:42:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:05.30,0:42:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:09.52,0:42:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I did something awful.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:13.10,0:42:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:14.56,0:42:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:17.61,0:42:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:21.36,0:42:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you rest up, you can get back on your feet.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:27.23,0:42:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:34.92,0:42:36.88,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Today's weather is sunny.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:36.88,0:42:41.86,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,The TV said it would be comfortable, \Nbut it's a little chilly for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:47.97,0:42:50.07,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I've gotten used to my new school.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:50.87,0:42:56.20,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to transfer, but there was \Nno point going to my old school anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:57.38,0:43:00.08,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Neiru managed to become human.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:01.03,0:43:03.83,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I didn't pick up the phone that day.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:05.11,0:43:07.76,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I was really busy for a while after that.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:08.20,0:43:10.46,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I kind of drifted apart from everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:11.62,0:43:15.01,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Still, I'll never forget that time.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:15.96,0:43:19.18,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I could never forget such a thrilling season.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:20.46,0:43:23.43,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I wish I could feel like that again.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:25.20,0:43:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of chilly today.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:26.80,0:43:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to snow tonight.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:28.64,0:43:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? It's so nice out.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:08.55,0:44:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:24.19,0:44:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How nice to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:27.95,0:44:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see Neiru!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:30.24,0:44:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you buy an Egg?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:31.83,0:44:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We would be thrilled if you would.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:34.29,0:44:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But what will you do if you can't see Neiru?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:37.12,0:44:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She might not want to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:39.50,0:44:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try again. As many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:42.21,0:44:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that Neiru wants to see me.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:45.76,0:44:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about confident. You already ran away once.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:49.55,0:44:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ura-Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:54.72,0:44:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto Ai...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:57.52,0:44:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,is back!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:35.32,0:46:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, set...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:36.83,0:46:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The end!
